// RUN: %clang_cc1 -verify %s

// A flat record wider than MaxOwnedFieldPaths. The schema walk expands the
// record graph one nesting level at a time, and level 1 -- the variable's own
// direct owned fields -- is always recorded in full, however wide the record
// is; the budget only decides which deeper levels are kept. A flat record is
// all level 1, so every field below is tracked and the second move-out is
// rejected. (Enforcing the budget inside the level-1 field loop dropped every
// field from the 257th on, and the second move-out below went unreported.)

void safe_free(void *_Owned);

